From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tompta1 <546706+tompta1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:39:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: gpio: describe Autumn D2401 boot-configured
 outputs

Describe the J120 radio-enable GPIO provider. Only inherited output modes are supported; direction changes and the PMIC event block remain unavailable.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../bindings/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml         | 12 ++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml
index 978a5a25e..28eb24b3a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml#
 $schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
 
-title: Apple A8/A9/A10 PMIC GPIO and event interrupt controller
+title: Apple A8/A9/A10/A10X PMIC GPIO and event interrupt controller
 
 maintainers:
   - Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
@@ -15,6 +15,10 @@ description: |
   respectively. The controller is accessed through the regmap exported by the
   parent Apple I2C PMIC device.
 
+  The Autumn D2401 provides 20 GPIOs. Only boot-configured outputs are
+  currently supported; direction switching and PMU event interrupts are not.
+  Boards must reserve lines that must remain under firmware control.
+
   The D2207 and D2365 also latch 112 and 240 PMU events respectively
   (charger, ADC, GPIO edges and others) in one read-to-clear block and
   signal them on a single active-low line to the AP. As an interrupt
@@ -37,6 +41,7 @@ properties:
       - apple,d2207-pmic-gpio
       - apple,d2333-pmic-gpio
       - apple,d2365-pmic-gpio
+      - apple,d2401-pmic-gpio
 
   gpio-controller: true
 
@@ -44,6 +49,7 @@ properties:
     const: 2
 
   gpio-reserved-ranges:
+    minItems: 1
     maxItems: 3
 
   interrupt-controller: true
@@ -84,7 +90,9 @@ allOf:
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
-          const: apple,d2333-pmic-gpio
+          enum:
+            - apple,d2333-pmic-gpio
+            - apple,d2401-pmic-gpio
     then:
       properties:
         interrupt-controller: false
